    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Dynamic programming</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Grid DP</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/unique-paths-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 63</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Unique Paths II</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Count right/down paths through a grid with rocks. Every free cell is reached from above or from the left, so <code>ways[r][c] = ways[r-1][c] + ways[r][c-1]</code>, and a rock is simply 0. One rolling row gives O(m·n) time and O(n) space; the only traps are the boundaries and integer overflow.</p>\n"
  },
